1
00:00:00,340 --> 00:00:04,080
(Sheldon:)They gave us science, democracy,

2
00:00:04,080 --> 00:00:07,970
(Sheldon:)and little cubes of charred meat
that taste like sweat.

3
00:00:11,190 --> 00:00:13,490
Penny? Penny?

4
00:00:13,490 --> 00:00:15,020
(Sheldon:)Penny?

5
00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:17,140
(Penny:)Hey. What's up?

6
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:21,060
(Sheldon:)The mean Indian lady tried
to make me eat lamb.

7
00:00:23,260 --> 00:00:24,770
(Sheldon:)Congratulations.

8
00:00:24,790 --> 00:00:26,330
(Sheldon:)Pizza night will now
be at your apartment.

9
00:00:26,330 --> 00:00:28,100
(Sheldon:)Order one.

10
00:00:28,100 --> 00:00:29,430
(Penny:)Oh, I'm sorry, honey,

11
00:00:29,450 --> 00:00:31,210
(Penny:)I'm meeting Amy and
Bernadette for dinner.

12
00:00:31,210 --> 00:00:33,210
(Penny:)But you're welcome
to tag along.

13
00:00:33,210 --> 00:00:34,480
A girls' night?

14
00:00:34,480 --> 00:00:36,540
(Sheldon:)Oh, I don't know
if I'm up for an evening

15
00:00:36,540 --> 00:00:39,850
(Sheldon:)talking about rainbows,
unicorns and menstrual cramps.

16
00:00:39,850 --> 00:00:42,170
(Penny:)Okay, suit yourself.

17
00:00:42,170 --> 00:00:44,750
(Penny:)We'll probably be
trashing Priya a little.

18
00:00:44,750 --> 00:00:47,420
(Sheldon:)Shotgun.

19
00:00:48,560 --> 00:00:50,390
(Penny:)Okay, I'd like
to propose a toast

20
00:00:50,390 --> 00:00:52,180
(Penny:)to a wonderful
girls' night out.

21
00:00:52,990 --> 00:00:56,630
(Amy:)Fair warning--
we can get ca-razy.

22
00:00:56,630 --> 00:01:01,020
(Bernadette:)Yeah. Last week we smoked cigars
and pretended to be dragons.

